    "custom_help_cards_postop": {
      "type": "custom-help-cards",
      "blocks": {
        "card_mastectomy_non": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/f500c53c78bd0f983f588e78210de83698668353.png",
            "title": "Mastectomy (Non-Reconstruction)",
            "text": "<p>Heavy, hot, and uncomfortable shouldn't be your only option. Our lightweight breast forms are cloud-soft, feel natural, and stay put through every workout, swim, and ordinary Tuesday so you can feel more like yourself again.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn more",
            "link": "#cbaf-template--31015706263838__custom_before_after_features_7anrNn"
          }
        },
        "card_mastectomy_recon": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/0c276ce13a4fd9521f4950d6a9c3166c62e1e8fd.jpg",
            "title": "Mastectomy (Reconstruction)",
            "text": "<p>Whether you're navigating expanders or implants, our inserts are made for life after reconstruction—cloud-soft and lightweight with just enough gentle shaping to feel like yourself again.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn more",
            "link": "#fyc-mastectomy-reconstruction"
          }
        },
        "card_lumpectomy": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bf281c0d18986e42c34d5f082b48082083b0b0e4.jpg",
            "title": "Lumpectomy",
            "text": "<p>Our inserts are designed to move with you after a lumpectomy—gently restoring balance and volume in a way that's cloud-soft, completely natural, and discreet enough that only you'll know they're there.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn more",
            "link": "#fyc-lumpectomy"
          }
        },
        "card_explant": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/c1a922f5f6f22fbcab9eb089e2136ec1d83f0c0e.jpg",
            "title": "Breast Explant Surgery",
            "text": "<p>This chapter looks different for every woman. Our lightweight inserts are designed to gently restore shape and volume—cloud-soft, natural-feeling, and discreet enough to wear comfortably through whatever comes next.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn more",
            "link": "#fyc-explant"
          }
        }
      },
