    "custom_breast_forms_showcase_rnBbPU": {
      "type": "custom-breast-forms-showcase",
      "blocks": {
        "product_phpKTM": {
          "type": "product",
          "settings": {
            "product": "teardrop-breast-form"
          }
        },
        "product_UV89YX": {
          "type": "product",
          "settings": {
            "product": "oval-breast-form"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "product_phpKTM",
        "product_UV89YX"
      ],
      "name": "Breast forms showcase",
      "settings": {
        "heading_line_1": "Breast Forms For",
        "heading_line_2": "Mastectomy (Non-Reconstruction)",
        "intro_text": "<p>For decades, women who've had a mastectomy have largely been given the same choice: hot, heavy, uncomfy silicone breast forms. Many women assume the weight, heat, and discomfort are simply part of life after surgery because no one ever tells them another option exists.<br/><br/>We believe you deserve better. Honey Cloudz Breast Forms were created to offer a lighter, more comfortable alternative without sacrificing a natural look. Our first-of-its-kind hybrid design combines cloud-soft foam with our patented 100% medical-grade silicone grippy-dot exterior to create breast forms that are lightweight (1-2oz), breathable, and engineered to stay comfortably in place inside pockets throughout your day.<br/><br/><strong>Feeling whole again isn't just about restoring your silhouette—it's about restoring your confidence.</strong><br/><br/>Whether you're running errands, hugging loved ones, exercising, traveling, swimming, or simply getting dressed in the morning, our goal is simple: to help you feel balanced, comfortable, and more like yourself again. <br/><br/></p>",
        "intro_spacing": 36,
        "use_theme_page_width": true,
        "content_max_width": 1200,
        "card_gap": 24,
        "card_max_width_desktop": 1040,
        "mobile_padding_x": 16,
        "padding_top": 48,
        "padding_bottom": 48,
        "shaping_level_label": "Shaping Level",
        "shaping_info_button_label": "About shaping level meter",
        "why_love_label": "Why You'll Love Them",
        "wear_with_label": "Wear It With",
        "button_prefix": "Learn More",
        "show_product_tags": false,
        "image_fit": "cover",
        "metafield_namespace": "custom",
        "shaping_level_key": "shaping_level",
        "shape_key": "shape",
        "product_tags_key": "product_tags",
        "why_love_key": "why_you_love_them",
        "wear_with_key": "wear_it_with",
        "testimonial_quote_key": "card_testimonial_quote",
        "testimonial_author_key": "card_testimonial_author",
        "shaping_popup_title": "Meet Our Shaping Level Meter",
        "shaping_popup_content": "<p>We created the “Shaping Level Meter” as an easy visual tool to help you identify which Cloudz has the exact amount of shaping you're looking for!<br/><br/><strong>Level 1</strong>: <strong>Ultra-light shaping</strong>. Smooths everything, helps prevent nip-show, and provides barely-there shaping.<br/><br/><strong>Level 2:</strong> <strong>Light shaping.</strong> Provides light, everyday shaping. They help create a natural looking shape, fills for mild breast volume loss, and balances up to 1/2 cup difference.<br/><br/><strong>Level 3:</strong> <strong>Medium shaping</strong>. Fuller and more defined shaping to help smooth divots, fill moderate breast volume loss, and balance up to 3/4 a cup. Also ideal for post-lumpectomy or explant balancing or filling upper breast region for flat-top implants.<br/><br/><strong>Level 4:</strong> <strong>Max shaping</strong>. Delivers our highest level of lift and enhancement to boost sagging, create natural fullness, and restore a perkier silhouette without looking overdone.<br/><br/><strong>Level 5:</strong> <strong>Complete shaping</strong>. Lightweight (1-2 oz.), breathable, and hug friendly breast forms. Designed for women post-mastectomy without breast reconstruction or significant asymmetry. <br/><br/></p>",
        "shaping_popup_close_label": "Close",
        "shaping_popup_background": "#ffffff",
        "shaping_popup_text_color": "#212326",
        "shaping_popup_border_radius": 12,
        "background_color": "#fdf7f4",
