    "custom_reviews_slider_postop": {
      "type": "custom-reviews-slider",
      "blocks": {
        "review_1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "“It’s freedom from being uncomfortable all the time”",
            "text": "<p>“I am quite amazed with my new lightweight boobs :) Double mastectomy 13 years ago, no reconstruction. For 13 years I have weathered the heavy, rubbery, sweat-inducing breast forms from the cancer center at the hospital. The bra was always tugging and lopsided because the breast forms were so heavy and sticky. <strong>Tried the Honey Cloudz teardrop shape. I was driving yesterday and almost forgot I had a bra and boobs on! They are comfortable, LIGHT WEIGHT and not sweat inducing</strong>. I am completely happy with my Honey Cloudz. It’s freedom from being uncomfortable all the time. HOORAY!!!”<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": "Liz N.",
            "show_verified": true
          }
        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "They are lightweight and feel soft and comfortable against my skin post-mastectomy",
            "text": "<p>\"The quality of the Honey Cloudz performance oval extra breast forms is exceptional. They are lightweight and feel soft and comfortable against my skin post-mastectomy. I felt there was less movement of the forms when I inserted them into the bra pockets. <strong>Most importantly, they look and feel very natural, and I am confident wearing them.</strong> Lovely packaging with illustrations on how to wear and care for the forms. I was so impressed with this product that I ordered another set. I had a question about my order, and the customer service representative was incredibly helpful and friendly. She resolved my issue quickly and efficiently. Her service was truly outstanding. I highly recommend Honey Cloudz breast forms and will be a repeat customer!\"<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": "Mary L.",
            "show_verified": true
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "“I absolutely love them and prefer them over the expensive forms I initially purchased”",
            "text": "<p>“After my double mastectomy and failed direct to implant reconstruction, I had no choice but to go flat.  I went to a local mastectomy boutique and purchased a very expensive pair of breast forms. Because I exercise/run daily and sweat a lot, I needed additional options so I ordered a pair of Honey Cloudz teardrop to try. I absolutely love them and prefer them over the expensive forms I initially purchased.  They are so lightweight, super comfortable, and so easy to wash in the mesh bag. <strong>I honestly forget I have them on which gives me such confidence in my clothes. </strong>I’ve ordered 3 pairs so far and recommend them to others every chance I get. They have made me feel normal again.”<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": "Theresa W.",
            "show_verified": true
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "“These are so lightweight and comfortable! They look so natural!”",
            "text": "<p>“I am a breast cancer survivor. I had a double mastectomy on 12/19. I got fitted for prosthetics but they are heavy and uncomfortable. I found Honey Cloudz in one of my online support groups. I first ordered the teardrop shaped inserts and absolutely love them. Now I ordered the oval and they are just as wonderful!!! These are so lightweight and comfortable! They look so natural! <strong>The other key feature that was important to me is I can wear them in my bathing suits and in my pool!</strong> How great is that?!!! I will keep coming back for more! Thank you Honey Cloudz!!!”<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": "Christine K.",
            "show_verified": true
          }
        },
        "review_5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "“Natural, light weight, cool and comfortable! I am so grateful”",
            "text": "<p>\"This being my 2nd go around with mastectomy surgery, I can give an honest, experienced comparison of mastectomy forms! Five years ago I was fitted with a hot, heavy, sweaty, uncomfortable, silicone form and was unable to wear it for five months after surgery! <strong>Fast forward to Feb. 2026, my second mastectomy. Three weeks after surgery I was comfortably wearing Honey Cloudz teardrop forms.</strong> Natural, light weight, cool and comfortable! I am so grateful. To top it all off, the company is personable, communicative and so easy to order from! I just ordered my second pair to keep a fresh set ready to wear!”<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": "Joan W.",
            "show_verified": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "review_1",
        "review_2",
        "review_3",
        "review_4",
        "review_5"
      ],
