            "tab_content": "<p>Whether it’s implant, flap, or oncoplastic reconstruction, your journey through revovery is unique. Still, you deserve inserts that not only help you look balanced in your clothes, but also feel comfortable and light against your healing skin. Our balancing inserts help you restore balance, are are cloud-soft and undetectable under any clothing—only you’ll know they’re there. Use our Shaping Level Meter to find what insert is right for you. </p>",
            "products": [
              "oval-lites-bra-inserts",
              "half-moon-classic-bra-inserts",
              "oval-classic-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-classic-bra-inserts",
              "oval-plus-bra-inserts",
              "oval-push-up-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-push-up-bra-inserts"
            ]
          }
        },
        "tab_3FzUVP": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Lumpectomy",
            "tab_content": "<p>Lumpectomy can leave dents and divots that changes symmetry and how clothes feel in our body. Our balancing inserts help seamlessly smooth dents or divots, and restore a symmetrical silhouette in a natural way under any outfit. Our patented grippy-dot exterior is designed to keep your inserts from moving or shifting, so you can wear them without worry. Use our Shaping Level Meter to find which insert thickness is best for you.</p>",
            "products": [
              "triangle-classic-bra-inserts",
              "half-moon-plus-bra-inserts",
              "oval-plus-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-plus-bra-inserts",
              "oval-push-up-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-push-up-bra-inserts"
            ]
          }
        },
        "tab_RLcqf3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Explant",
            "tab_content": "<p>Finding the right support after explant surgery shouldn’t be a struggle. Honey Cloudz balancing inserts gently restore shape, fullness, and balance whithout compromising comfort. They're lightweight, breathable, and cloud-soft against healing skin. Use our Shaping Level Meter to find which insert thickness is best for you.</p>",
            "products": [
              "oval-classic-bra-inserts",
              "half-moon-classic-bra-inserts",
              "oval-plus-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-push-up-bra-inserts",
